1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,337
Running ten Claudes at once?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,690
Ten terminals. One of you.

3
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,182
What if you just said it?

4
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:12,223
Say it into your phone, whenever it hits.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,802
Tag it. It's a ticket.

6
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:19,456
One loop checks in every ten minutes, and ships them, one by one.

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,338
You only hear back when it's done.

8
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,483
Stop babysitting terminals.

9
00:00:25,603 --> 00:00:27,223
Become the orchestrator.

10
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,516
Loop engineering, with Contextli.
